@Lovable.dev helped fourth-generation barber Nour Eddin Khalil turn his industry experience into a real software product.
 
Instead of coming from a traditional tech background, Khalil used Lovable to build Klippvia and bring his idea to life.
 
His story shows how AI coding tools are making it easier for people with real-world expertise to turn their ideas into working products, without needing years of coding experience.
 
@lovable.dev lets anyone build real software just by chatting with AI,
